invariant: INV-16
file: aead.c
catches: test/lint-runtime-symbols.sh
reason: on a core with no multiplier a new `*` in aead.c becomes a call
  to __mulsi3, and the old gate subtracted softmul.c's definition of that
  name from the union of every file's undefined symbols before judging,
  so the call was invisible; each file's runtime calls are judged in
  that file now, and aead.c is allowed none

--- old
    poly1305_update(&p, len, 16);
--- new
    poly1305_update(&p, len, (size_t)((unsigned)aad_len * (unsigned)n) & 16U);
